    /* ONE white studio. Every garment sits in the same light, so the row does
       not read as five unrelated rectangular photographs. */
    /* FALLBACK (no script): the stage is simply the white studio and every
       project is a normal grid cell inside it. Complete, scrollable and
       readable — the queue below is an enhancement layered on top of this,
